  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Market Development in the Niger Delta</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims to increase the incomes of 150,000 poor people in the Niger Delta region of Nigeria, through improvement in performance and inclusiveness of key market sectors; raising beneficiaries&#x2019; incomes by between 40 &#x2013; 50% by September 2018, of which 50% will be women</narrative>
  </description>
